cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ReproLab, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "ReproLab: record, replay and reduce failures of agent and automation workflows"
abstract: >-
  ReproLab records what an agent or automation does at its boundaries, replays it offline,
  injects simulated faults, explores fault schedules with a fixed seed, reduces failures to
  1-minimal traces that keep the same violated business property, and replays stored failures
  against new code as regression tests. Python standard library and SQLite only.
authors:
  - alias: Andros5
    website: "https://github.com/Andros5"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Andros5/reprolab"
url: "https://github.com/Andros5/reprolab"
license: MIT
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-11-14"
keywords:
  - record and replay
  - fault injection
  - delta debugging
  - agents
  - reproducibility
  - regression testing
